### Playtest: a seeded 3-player game played to the end in three battles.
# Start the server with `mise run server`, then run the requests top to bottom in IntelliJ.
# Seed 42 deals: anna 1 Horde + Wood + Essence, ben 1 Horde + 2 Essence, cleo 1 Horde + Iron + Wood.
# Counters: Bow beats Mage, Sword beats Bow, Mage beats Sword. Bonuses: tier 1 +1 against Horde
# and the tier-1 unit it counters; tier 2 +4 against Horde and the tier-1 unit it counters, +2
# against any other tier-1 unit and the tier-2 unit it counters. Only the best bonus counts.
# First to 3 VP wins; this game ends in battle 3.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create a game for 3 players; anna hosts
POST {{host}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "players": 3, "host": "anna", "seed": 42 }

> {% client.global.set("gameId", response.body.gameId); %}

### ben joins
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ben" }

### cleo joins — the game is full and turn 1 starts
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "cleo" }

### anna's view: BUILD_UP, pot 1, her hand, available actions TRADE / UPGRADE / READY
GET {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}?player=anna

### ── Turn 1: build-up ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### anna upgrades a Horde into a Bow (Horde + Wood)
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "BOW" }

### ben upgrades a Horde into a Mage (Horde + Essence)
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "MAGE" }

### ben tries to turn that Mage into a High Mage right away — 400: a unit climbs one tier per turn
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "HIGH_MAGE" }

### cleo trades her Iron for a Horde
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resource": "IRON" }

### anna is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/ready

### ben is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/ready

### cleo is ready — the battle starts
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/ready

### ── Turn 1: battle (upgraded units stay home) ──────────────────────
# Nobody commits anything, so everyone sits out: no duels, nobody wins, and the
# victory point rolls over.

### anna keeps her Bow back and commits nothing
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/army
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ben keeps his Mage back and commits nothing
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/army
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### cleo keeps her 2 Horde back too — the battle resolves
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/army
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ben's view: battle 1 in the log with no winner; turn 2 with a pot of 2
GET {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}?player=ben

### ── Turn 2: build-up ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### ben upgrades his Mage, held since last turn, into a High Mage (Mage + Essence)
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "HIGH_MAGE" }

### anna is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/ready

### ben is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/ready

### cleo is ready — the battle starts
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/ready

### ── Turn 2: battle (the High Mage decides it) ─────────────────────
# Duels: anna–ben 3:6 (anna's Bow +1 vs Horde, nothing vs the higher-tier High Mage;
#        ben's High Mage +4 vs Horde beats +2 vs the Bow), anna–cleo 3:3, ben–cleo 6:3
# → scores anna −3, ben +6, cleo −3. ben wins the double pot (2 VP).
# Casualties: anna loses her Bow, ben his Horde, cleo 2 of her 3 Horde.

### anna commits her Bow and 1 Horde
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "BOW": 1, "HORDE": 1 }

### ben commits his High Mage and 1 Horde
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "HIGH_MAGE": 1, "HORDE": 1 }

### cleo commits 3 Horde — the battle resolves
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "HORDE": 3 }

### ben's view: battle 2 won by ben with the double pot (2 VP); turn 3 with a pot of 1
GET {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}?player=ben

### ── Turn 3: build-up ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hands: anna 2 Horde + 2 Essence + 2 Iron + Wood, ben High Mage + Horde + 3 Iron + Wood,
# cleo 2 Horde + 2 Iron + 3 Wood. ben needs 1 more VP. Without a Bow, nobody can build the
# Warbow that counters his High Mage this turn.

### anna goes wide: trades an Iron for a Horde
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resource": "IRON" }

### anna trades her second Iron
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resource": "IRON" }

### anna trades her Wood — 5 Horde, and she keeps her 2 Essence
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resource": "WOOD" }

### ben upgrades his Horde into a Sword (Horde + Iron)
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "SWORD" }

### cleo upgrades a Horde into a Sword
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "SWORD" }

### cleo upgrades her other Horde into a Sword
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "SWORD" }

### anna is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/ready

### ben is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/ready

### cleo is ready — the battle starts
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/ready

### ── Turn 3: battle (the High Mage again) ──────────────────────────
# Duels: anna–ben 5:7 (ben's High Mage +4 and Sword +1 vs anna's Horde),
#        anna–cleo 5:4 (cleo's Swords only +1 each vs Horde, so going wide wins this duel),
#        ben–cleo 6:2 (the High Mage gets +4 vs the Swords it counters; the Swords get
#        nothing vs the High Mage or a Sword)
# → scores anna −1, ben +6, cleo −5. ben wins with 3 VP and the game is over.

### anna commits her 5 Horde
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "HORDE": 5 }

### ben commits his High Mage and his new Sword
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "HIGH_MAGE": 1, "SWORD": 1 }

### cleo commits her 2 Swords and no Horde — the battle resolves
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "SWORD": 2 }

### ben's view: GAME_OVER, ben wins with 3 VP; no actions left
GET {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}?player=ben
